28.m:
For that is suitable as the material cause, even though there is a difference of bodies;
difference and non-difference pertaining to the physical lineage do not bring about such a state in the continuity of consciousness,
just like a corpse entered by a yogin's will.

Even if the guru is not present there, he must be worshipped by visualizing him as before;
and one should assign that substance to the service of the deity, or among the devotees.
Now this occasional ritual has divisions such as the festival days (parvan) and the sacred thread ceremony (pavitra).
